    <bpmn:process id="W_W478" name="W478. BIR Annual Inventory List Submission (RMC 57-2015)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Calendar year-end close (December 31) triggers the statutory compliance requirement
Frequency: Annual (submitted on or before January 30 of the following year)
Volume: ~35,000 active SKUs (~55,000 item-master records incl. seasonal/discontinued) across 200 stores and 4 DCs
Owner: Tax Manager
Participants: Tax Accountant, Cost Accountant, Inventory Control Manager, IT Database Administrator, CFO, External Auditor
Source: workflow W478 — BIR Annual Inventory List Submission (RMC 57-2015)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W478_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W478_Lane1" name="Cost Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W478_Lane2" name="IT Database Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W478_Lane3" name="Tax Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W478_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W478_Start5" name="Calendar year-end close (December 31) triggers the statutory compliance requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task6" name="Reconciliation &amp; Lock">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reconciliation &amp; Lock: Following year-end physical inventory counts (W42) and system close (W9B), Cost Accountant performs inventory valuation verification and posts final variance adjustments. Inventory sub-ledgers are officially closed and locked.
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Inventory Control Manager
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task7" name="Raw Data Extraction">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Raw Data Extraction: IT Database Administrator runs the specialized database script to extract ending inventory quantities and Weighted Average Costs (WAC) per SKU across all warehouses, yards (W3B), and stores as of December 31, 23:59.
Responsible (R): IT Database Administrator
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task8" name="Cost Validation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cost Validation: Cost Accountant reconciles extracted quantities and costs against general ledger balances. If variance is found (e.g. from goods in transit or unposted receipts), adjusts details to match the final audited trial balance.
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task9" name="BIR Spreadsheet Formatting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: BIR Spreadsheet Formatting: Tax Accountant converts the validated inventory files into the mandatory format prescribed by RMC 57-2015, categorizing inventory under separate schedules (e.g. Merchandising Inventory, Supplies/Consumables).
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 1.5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task10" name="Audit Alignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Audit Alignment: Tax Accountant aligns with the External Auditor to ensure ending inventory lists match the audited financial statement disclosure schedules.
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task11" name="Sworn Declaration &amp; DVD Burning">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Sworn Declaration &amp; DVD Burning: Tax Accountant drafts the required Sworn Declaration (attesting to the accuracy of the electronic data), routing it for notarization and signatures. The formatted Excel/CSV files are written to a DVD-R or prepared for secure BIR e-submission.
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W478_Task12" name="Submission &amp; Archiving">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Submission &amp; Archiving: Tax Accountant submits the physical DVD-R and notarized Sworn Declaration to the Large Taxpayers Service (LTS) or local Revenue District Office (RDO) before January 30. Uploads the stamped-received copy to the Document Management System (W255) and updates the Compliance Calendar.
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W478_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W478_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W478_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W478_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-291 (ensure controlled execution — Tax &amp; Statutory (PA-17.3).) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Tax Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
